{"id":2296,"date":"2024-09-19T12:33:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:33:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2296"},"modified":"2025-10-02T12:31:29","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T12:31:29","slug":"cardboard-food-packaging","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-food-packaging\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Food Packaging"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Bulk Meal Packaging Solutions for Catering Services<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a> offer high-quality <strong>cardboard food packaging<\/strong> that meets the needs of food brands, restaurants, takeout services, and bakeries. Whether you\u2019re packing hot meals, snacks, baked items, or frozen food, our boxes are designed to hold them safely and present them neatly. Available in custom sizes, styles, and printing options, our packaging supports your brand while maintaining food safety and freshness.<\/p>\n<p>Our solutions are ideal for businesses searching for <strong>cardboard food packaging wholesale<\/strong> with quick turnaround and affordable pricing. You can also order <strong>large cardboard food packaging<\/strong> for bulk meals or catering services. These boxes are made with food-safe materials and offer a clean, professional look.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>High-Quality Disposable Paper Food Containers for Every Meal<\/h2>\n<h3>Safe and Practical for All Food Types<\/h3>\n<p>We produce <strong>disposable paper food containers<\/strong> using food-grade cardboard that resists grease, moisture, and heat. These containers are suited for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hot meals like burgers, fries, pasta, and wraps<\/li>\n<li>Cold items such as salads and desserts<\/li>\n<li>Baked goods, pastries, and breads<\/li>\n<li>Frozen items ready for transport or retail display<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you\u2019re selling from a food truck, caf\u00e9, or retail shelf, our food containers keep your items secure and presentable.<\/p>\n<h3>Custom Printed to Match Your Brand<\/h3>\n<p>Packaging is the first thing your customer sees. With our custom printing services, you can add:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Brand logos and colors<\/li>\n<li>Nutrition facts and ingredients<\/li>\n<li>Reheating or storage instructions<\/li>\n<li>QR codes or seasonal messages<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Print both inside and outside the box for a better unboxing experience. Your food stays safe, and your brand stays visible.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 322px;\" width=\"775\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sizes<\/td>\n<td>All Custom Sizes (Small, Medium, Large Cardboard Food Packaging)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Kraft, Corrugated, White SBS, Eco Cardstock<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Offset, Digital, Inside &amp; Outside Printing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Options<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Styles<\/td>\n<td>Tuck End, Gable, Mailer, Tray, Clamshell<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inserts &amp; Add-ons<\/td>\n<td>Food-safe Liners, Grease-Resistant Layers, Handles, Die-cut Windows<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quantity Range<\/td>\n<td>100 \u2013 500,000 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Support<\/td>\n<td>Free Custom Design Assistance<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days; Rush Delivery Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Packaging Styles for a Range of Food Items<\/h2>\n<h3>Multiple Box Styles to Choose From<\/h3>\n<p>Our food packaging boxes come in a range of shapes and closures depending on your menu and packaging goals.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gable boxes with handles for easy takeaway<\/li>\n<li>Mailer-style boxes for deliveries<\/li>\n<li>Clamshell trays for fast food and baked goods<\/li>\n<li>Tuck end boxes for snacks and shelf-ready items<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also add grease-resistant liners and vents for hot meals to retain freshness and prevent sogginess.<\/p>\n<h3>Large Options for Catering and Group Meals<\/h3>\n<p>Need packaging for large orders or catering trays? We provide large cardboard food packaging such as <strong><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-pizza-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"313\">Cardboard Pizza Boxes<\/a><\/strong> suitable for multiple meal packs, bakery assortments, or holiday platters.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ideal for event catering<\/li>\n<li>Supports heavy or multiple items<\/li>\n<li>Custom inserts available to separate contents<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Add branding to the lid or side panels to reinforce your business identity with every order.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Order Food Packaging Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Save More with High-Volume Orders<\/h3>\n<p>Our food packaging boxes wholesale pricing ensures you get maximum value at minimum cost. Bulk orders on <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/food-related-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"374\">Food Related Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> reduce per-unit price and help maintain supply throughout busy seasons.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Competitive wholesale pricing<\/li>\n<li>Flexible minimum order quantities<\/li>\n<li>Consistent packaging quality across large batches<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Suited for Food Businesses of All Types<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you own a small bakery or run a large-scale meal prep service, we\u2019ve got packaging solutions for your scale and needs.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Restaurants and cafes<\/li>\n<li>Food trucks and cloud kitchens<\/li>\n<li>Supermarkets and grocery stores<\/li>\n<li>Catering companies and wholesalers<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Add Value with Finishes and Extras<\/h2>\n<h3>Make Your Boxes More Eye-Catching<\/h3>\n<p>We offer a variety of finishes to improve the visual and tactile experience of your packaging.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss finish for rich color appearance<\/li>\n<li>Matte coating for a smooth, glare-free texture<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV to highlight your logo or promotional messages<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Foil stamping in gold or silver<\/li>\n<li>Embossed brand elements<\/li>\n<li>Die-cut windows to showcase the food inside<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These extras help your packaging stand out in competitive food markets.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Simple and Fast Ordering Process<\/h2>\n<h3>How to Get Started<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Share your food packaging needs and dimensions<\/li>\n<li>Select your preferred box style and finish<\/li>\n<li>Upload your logo or branding elements<\/li>\n<li>Review and approve a free digital proof<\/li>\n<li>Finalize your order and wait for delivery<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Our team will support you at every step, from concept to completion.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Full custom options for size, style, and print<\/li>\n<li>Eco-friendly and food-safe materials<\/li>\n<li>Free design assistance and shipping<\/li>\n<li>Fast turnaround times (as quick as 4\u20136 business days)<\/li>\n<li>High-resolution CMYK and PMS printing<\/li>\n<li>Coating options: Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Support for bulk and retail orders<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you need simple <strong>disposable paper food containers<\/strong> or branded <strong>cardboard food packaging wholesale<\/strong>, we provide fast, reliable, and affordable solutions that fit your food service business.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for high-quality food packaging at wholesale prices. We offer custom sizes and styles, ensuring the perfect fit for your needs. With fast turnaround times and high-quality materials, we ensure your packaging is both durable and visually appealing. Contact us today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2426,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[183],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2296","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-food-related-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Buy Cardboard Food Packaging | Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-quality cardboard food packaging solutions. Customizable and durable, ideal for takeout, delivery, and retail. Order Now!\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-food-packaging\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Buy Cardboard Food Packaging | Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"High-quality cardboard food packaging solutions. Customizable and durable, ideal for takeout, delivery, and retail. Order Now!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-food-packaging\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T12:31:29+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Cardboard-Food-Packaging-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>